{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03848","headline":"使岭南闻崔马二御史竝拜台郎 · 苏味道","name":"使岭南闻崔马二御史竝拜台郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"振鹭齐飞日，迁莺远听闻。\n明光共待漏，清鉴各披云。\n喜得廊庙举，嗟爲台阁分。\n故林怀柏悦，新幄阻兰薰。\n冠去神羊影，车迎瑞雉羣。\n远从南斗外，遥仰列星文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}